{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50721","headline":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其四（原注：春日寓言。） · 张祜","name":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其四（原注：春日寓言。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞春风意未降，酒狂诗癖旧无双。\n柳花飞处曾逢雪，桃叶开提忆渡江。\n自古不堪居陋巷，从今休更犯危邦。\n圣朝何用询名姓，从放书生老北窗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}